  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRC Green Mini-Grid Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will develop three solar green mini-grid pilot projects, bringing clean and modern energy to sizeable towns.

&#x2022; The programme is the first of its kind and scale in the country, from the perspective that it incorporates a battery storage solution to ensure a continuous supply to consumers overcoming the intermittence of solar generation, while catering to a demand across various consumer categories. 
&#x2022; The framework aims to address the financing bottlenecks that the private sector faces in developing green mini-grid projects. The framework provides a tailored financing structure that will facilitate the participation of local and international sponsors, which until now have not participated in the financing of green mini-grid projects of such scale.
&#x2022; The programme has the potential to pave the way for the design and implementation of future green mini-grid programmes across the country and in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
